---
import { EXPLORER_TOOLS } from "../../lib/explorer-registry";
import "../explorer.css";
---
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" /><meta name="description" content="Private candidate for manually initiated read-only public-chain inspection." /><title>PIT Explorer · Read-only candidate</title></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to main content</a><main id="main" class="shell"><header><a class="brand" href="/">pit<span>.</span> explorer</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Explorer</a></nav><span class="tag">READ-ONLY CANDIDATE</span></header><section class="hero"><h1>Inspect public-chain data when you choose.</h1><p>Enter an address, token, name or transaction hash and start a bounded read on Ethereum or Base. No wallet connection, signature or transaction is available.</p><p class="muted">Public RPC providers receive the inputs you submit. Results are snapshots at displayed blocks, not complete security assessments.</p></section><div class="grid">{EXPLORER_TOOLS.map((tool) => <a class="card" href={`/inspect/${tool.id}/`}><h2>{tool.title}</h2><p>{tool.question}</p><small>Manual read · public RPC · no wallet</small></a>)}</div><footer>Private candidate · No indexing · No financial advice</footer></main></body></html>
